{
  "_note": "Cross-platform vectors for packages/shared/src/algorithms/counterSettings.ts <-> apps/ios/OYBC/Helpers/CounterSettings.swift (docs/SHARED_COUNTER_SETTINGS.md §1), plus the template-aware isAutoCounterTitle / counterCopyTitle in taskTitle.ts <-> TaskTitle.swift. Shared by packages/shared/tests/algorithms/counterSettings.test.ts and apps/ios/OYBCTests/CounterSettingsVectorTests.swift. A root's absent field is omitted (countKind absent = discrete). Rendering: goal == 1 -> singular template (absent -> the plural), else plural; '#N' -> the count (Duration 'Xh Ym', else the 2dp-trimmed number, locale-free); no stored template -> the legacy formula; goal-less -> the name. D4 derivation: nearest set timeframe (tie -> the shorter), scaled by nominal days 1/7/30/365, ceil to the kind's step.",
